Implemented Story 3.2 and completed the dev-story workflow. The ops route now derives a single readiness model from the public dashboard snapshot, exposes it through a local-only health endpoint, and renders a real read-only readiness panel instead of placeholder actions.

Key changes:
- Added ops readiness derivation in [get-ops-health.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/ops/get-ops-health.js) and a thin route helper in [create-ops-health-route-response.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/lib/server/ops/create-ops-health-route-response.js).
- Added the local-only endpoint at [route.ts](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/api/ops/health/route.ts) and passed server-derived status into [page.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/(ops)/ops/page.tsx).
- Replaced the placeholder ops panel in [OpsShell.tsx](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/components/OpsShell.tsx), with supporting view/copy updates in [ops-shell-view.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/ops-shell-view.js), [ops-shell-content.js](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/features/ops/ops-shell-content.js), and styling in [globals.css](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/src/app/globals.css).
- Added coverage in [ops-health.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-health.test.mjs), [ops-shell.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/unit/ops-shell.test.mjs), and updated [startup-smoke.test.mjs](/home/codexuser/bmad-6-workshop/tests/smoke/startup-smoke.test.mjs).

